  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES75:14620",
   "off": 83488,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「いにしえの知識の分身\r  たちは 大聖堂を中心に\r  結ばれているといいます」\u0010",
   "en": "\"They say the Ancient Knowledge's other selves are all linked together, with the Cathedral at the centre.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES75:1466e",
   "off": 83566,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「なまじ魔法が使えるために\r  独自の技術が進歩しないの\r  では…」\u0010",
   "en": "\"Perhaps it's precisely because we can use magic that our own technology never advances...\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES75:146b3",
   "off": 83635,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「一部の技術だけが極端に\r  進んでいる…\u0010\b  おかしな世界だと\r  思いませんか？」\u0010",
   "en": "\"Only certain technologies are wildly advanced...\u0010\bDon't you think it's a strange world?\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  }
 ]
}
